From 4bcc963952fa715c2c82857dacec2d2f995d1e21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Jan 2026 04:47:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] F-018: Add daily dungeon quests to repeatable XP list

Add Horde and Alliance daily dungeon quest IDs to the repeatable quest
handler so they grant XP rewards when repeatableVanillaQuestsXp is enabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
